+# HDN vanilla authority — client source
+
+This branch preserves the client-side half of the HDN vanilla authority
+release without importing unrelated changes from the shared production
+worktree.
+
+Base: `5ac4cb937bcd455ca5e3cfe754d657257ff9f820`.
+
+The feature consists of:
+
+- `vanillaAuthorityPolicy.ts`: fail-closed mask, short-lived controlled menu
+  leases and the local progression projection.
+- `vanillaAuthorityService.ts`: native policy attestation/reapplication and
+  repair of vanilla level, XP, perk-point and skill drift.
+- `vanillaAuthorityPolicy.test.ts`: pure policy, lease and projection tests.
+- `menuPolicyService.ts`: reactive compatibility barrier using the same
+  effective mask, with direct `MagicMenu` close and no synthetic Escape.
+- `index.ts`: one `VanillaAuthorityService` registration and retirement of
+  the four former client-owned perk/skill services.
+- `check-services-registered.js`: the retired historical services are
+  explicitly disabled rather than required by the packaging guard.
+
+Production pairing on 2026-07-25:
+
+- client `2026.07.25-234823`;
+- client ZIP SHA256
+  `ae185c4777ebdd0ee5078bfe3f10254a9ea397e51dee8e1119d38ec9613b3dd2`;
+- client JS SHA256
+  `7fbb9da47e45cdf7c3353b5ac99a35c186c7114ea00d4ee01231b7ece4d5e1f5`;
+- native runtime commit
+  `c893ab9d13f503f3ed719404d7175dcb5e2c229c`;
+- native runtime ZIP SHA256
+  `a000b78e0d06e2282f5f171555fd5aacbbe796a3a61c9310771a07c3b01f3b61`.
+
+The pure policy suite passes with mask `255`, controlled Crafting lease,
+expiry/release fail-closed behavior and progression projection replacement.
+The production bundle contains exactly one `VanillaAuthorityService`, none of
+the four retired registrations and no appended fallback runtime.
+
+The complete HDN worktree contains many newer systems not present in this base.
+They are intentionally absent from this branch; merge or cherry-pick this
+commit into the current HDN source line instead of replacing that line.
